nsports players into a fresh, throwback comic-book-style world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a memorable cast of characters, each with their own story to tell during your adventures. We’re taking all sorts of brains in all sorts of jars!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every nook and cranny to discover collectibles and secrets. Rare comic books will unveil the mysteries of the Brainioid invasion, and blueprints will help you build new weapons, minion upgrades, and hero abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332430/extras/e3742d7463d6f1cf3c5161d1eb6651ee.poster.avif?t=1776439362\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332430/extras/e3742d7463d6f1cf3c5161d1eb6651ee.webm?t=1776439362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332430/extras/e3742d7463d6f1cf3c5161d1eb6651ee.mp4?t=1776439362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Build bases, lead an army of robots, and squash brains in this radical hybrid between RTS and third-person shooter. Join a duo of quirky heroes on a mission to save Earth, smash an evil alien corporation, and complete their comic book collection.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Bulgarian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332430/header.jpg?t=1776439362", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332430/b6cd825c0fde964d61aacf39c1a1f9c96a2c3171/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776439362", "capsule_imag